Subject: [PATCH] Leaf: Bound the POI visited-section bitmap

Use a bitmap only when the search and its one-section halo fit the budget and the existing packed coordinates round trip. Preserve neighbor enqueue order and use the original packed-key set as fallback.

Original patch: https://github.com/Winds-Studio/Leaf/blob/06c9c91a17e61aeed16bcfc846ebe91aa70d6c84/leaf-server/minecraft-patches/features/0295-Optimize-PoiAccess-visited-section-tracking.patch

